  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Korttidsexpert till V&#xE4;rldsbankens projekt ang&#xE5;ende understationer ti Fj&#xE4;rrv&#xE4;rmeprojektet. Svensk part &#xE4;r FVB District Energy AB, genom NN . &#xD6;verf&#xF6;ring av kunskap om modern teknologi till ryska beslutsfattare inom fj&#xE4;rrv&#xE4;rmesektorn. Utarbetning av f&#xF6;rslag vg prod av varmvatten till grund f&#xF6;r V&#xE4;rldsbankens beslut om finansiering</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The puspose is to strengthen the federal Russian authority responsible for selection of district heating (DH) companies applying for World Bank loans. A Swedish long term expert (FVB District Energy AB)will assists the Russian authorities and develop a proposal which will be used as a starting-point for the World Bank&apos;s decision.</narrative>
